Note on third-party software:

The game loads the three.js 3D library (https://threejs.org) from the unpkg content
delivery network at runtime. three.js is distributed under its own MIT license, which
permits exactly this kind of use, and is not bundled with or redistributed by this
repository. Everything else in toad-game.html — the world, the toad, the flies, the
artwork and the sound — is generated by the game's own code.
